# --- env secrets (enforced) ---
# Every env file is a secret unless it is an example/template. A narrow pattern
# like `.env.*.local` does NOT match `.env.dev` — that gap put live
# credentials on a remote once. Match broadly, allow-list narrowly.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env*.example
!.env*.template
